{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"06e80b88772f0c298c7df27cdf0a313046649765b38e171d8265443ab0930b81","ja":"真美の秘密の夜……！？","zh":"真美的秘密之夜……！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"34ca3f2f1a43e3f2193a61ef7e94199c4988027f6f0c4b959c5b7d2b279985d1","ja":"レッスンお疲れ～！　んじゃ、\n真美は予定があるから、残ってくね～！","zh":"练习辛苦啦～！那，\n真美还有安排，就先走啦～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2298ab9a1a19653999c08318f47a90aba686a53dd19f3379acea41b1bb538f4b","ja":"あっ、そうなんだ！\nエミリーちゃん、私たちは先に帰らせてもらおうか。","zh":"啊，这样啊！\n艾米莉，那我们就先回去吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"9a5ed74f5ed0e90b627a37c02fafd86d7101dca20629d68ea9ce67952d52a5bf","ja":"はい……あの、もし居残りで稽古をされるようでしたら\n私もご一緒しましょうか……？","zh":"好的……那个，如果您打算留下来加练的话，\n要不要我也陪您一起呢……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"66c45299214b3490e692d5bb3946a225c457184167e23c90b82b8cb230a0b96b","ja":"う、ううん。これは真美の問題だから大丈夫だよ！\nふたりとも、真美のことは気にしないで帰っちゃって！","zh":"没、没事啦。这是真美自己的问题，所以没关系的！\n你们两个不用管真美，快回去吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"f17314b9038ac7bdf511e7b9e0612a003082f982e08a4c8252d33e9518610eb2","ja":"わかりました。\nではまた明日、よろしくお願いいたします！","zh":"好的。\n那么明天也请多多关照！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"16fd4cdff6aedbcf629acb1d3b2bb44c70b06b0cd815d5085c91c8668eaddbfc","ja":"真美ちゃん、残って自主レッスン続けてるのかな？\nやる気があるわね。","zh":"真美还在留下来继续自主练习吗？\n真有干劲呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"37fa6c331a99f0cff1ef39d70cc749e21fb86c3bba3b056be4736a390361cac9","ja":"もしかしたら、前回の公演の熱が\n残っているのかもしれませんね……あっ！","zh":"或许是因为上一场演出的狂热\n还在延续吧……啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"9c0d744969dd9ba3db2e49866ab6bfc761f241034def6b687dc3b05a402e7c26","ja":"稽古場に、水筒を忘れてしまいました。すみません、\n取りに戻るので風花さんは先に帰ってください。","zh":"我把水壶落在排练室了。不好意思，\n我回去拿一下，风花小姐就先回去吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"9afbb72b8b71b1b78d81c4d468ae32a90edc3bcf9b0c479945e43babb6880e15","ja":"いいわよ、一緒に戻りましょ。居残りで頑張ってる\n真美ちゃんに、飲み物でも差し入れしたいし♪","zh":"好啊，一起回去吧。我也想给留下来\n继续努力的真美带点喝的去呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"4f473f3cdc712350402a7c5959c2dde9292d61a24a29e2ad443ae7ee52cc1d36","ja":"そうしてレッスンルームに戻ったふたりが、\n扉をわずかに開くと……","zh":"就这样回到练习室的两人，\n将门微微打开一条缝隙后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"05488b2ff5a073fe7963d3c20d8e98e8d61e0f36672240567e3c9a15cf3158a7","ja":"えっ……！？","zh":"咦……！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1152.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"f319461fffe9d32ffd0072f3c1717462392bdd3430fca149405233eb4296e776","ja":"な、なにをしてるの！？","zh":"你、你在做什么啊！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
